      "cooked": "<p>I do wish there were more 'support' villain options.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>In our group, often one villain is not enough, but two are too much. Would very much like to see an idea about smattering the game with lesser villains capable of filling the hole...much like the option the Chairman has.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Ideas?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>p.s. So far Omnitron does this well.</p>",
