      "created_at": "2012-08-29T19:15:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>&nbsp;the Operative is not an \"option\" really,&nbsp; its part of the Chairman villain.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you're talking about adding on a few guys who could serve as Heralds do for Arkham Horror, I wouldn't be opposed to the plan.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Still, I agree with Rabbit, I'm guessing that you are not playing on Advanced mode,&nbsp; because if you were, Omnitron would be about the last guy I'd want to have teaming up with the main baddie.&nbsp; I would reccommend trying that first before asking for additional challenges =p.</p>",
