      "created_at": "2012-08-29T19:51:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Actually, there's nothing about this that couldn't be done by anyone with some time (except the art maybe).&nbsp; Just make up a couple of mini-bosses you could toss into a fight if you wanted a different level of challenge.&nbsp; Omnitron's Prime Devices or Baron Blade's Battalion Leaders or a couple of new named Citizens.&nbsp; Give them some Operative- or Ennead-level abilities and put them into play when you first lay out the villain card.&nbsp; Sounds fun.</p>",
